      "id": "thm-ftc-second-part-step-2-1",
      "claim": "By [L4] applied on $I_i$ there is $\\xi_i \\in (t_i,t_{i+1})$ with $G(t_{i+1}) - G(t_i) = f(\\xi_i)\\,\\Delta_i$; since $\\xi_i \\in I_i$ and $\\Delta_i > 0$, [L2] gives $m_i\\Delta_i \\le G(t_{i+1})-G(t_i) \\le M_i\\Delta_i$. [step 1.1, L1, L2, L4, L7]",
